 Me.","key":true,"vs":[10,43],"say":"Then Krishna widens it to all of life. Verse twenty-seven. O Arjuna, whatever you do, whatever you eat, whatever you offer as oblation to the sacred fire, whatever charity you give, whatever austerity you perform, do all that as an offering unto Me.","start":145.632,"at":146.208,"end":163.944,"words":[[0.125,0.263,"Then"],[0.4,0.475,"Krishna"],[0.887,0.537,"widens"],[1.438,0.188,"it"],[1.637,0.125,"to"],[1.775,0.237,"all"],[2.025,0.1,"of"],[2.138,0.525,"life"],[3.05,0.362,"Verse"],[3.425,0.9,"twenty-seven"],[4.713,0.175,"O"],[4.9,0.562,"Arjuna"],[5.662,0.375,"whatever"],[6.05,0.163,"you"],[6.225,0.312,"do"],[6.713,0.35,"whatever"],[7.075,0.163,"you"],[7.25,0.338,"eat"],[7.8,0.362,"whatever"],[8.175,0.138,"you"],[8.325,0.312,"offer"],[8.65,0.15,"as"],[8.812,0.5,"oblation"],[9.325,0.087,"to"],[9.425,0.1,"the"],[9.537,0.412,"sacred"],[9.963,0.425,"fire"],[10.637,0.362,"whatever"],[11.012,0.425,"charity"],[11.45,0.138,"you"],[11.6,0.362,"give"],[12.2,0.388,"whatever"],[12.6,0.537,"austerity"],[13.15,0.113,"you"],[13.275,0.55,"perform"],[14.113,0.163,"do"],[14.287,0.212,"all"],[14.512,0.263,"that"],[14.787,0.087,"as"],[14.887,0.1,"an"],[15.0,0.388,"offering"],[15.4,0.25,"unto"],[15.662,0.263,"Me"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L6"],"ref":"9.30","verse":"Even if the most sinful person resolves to worship Me with single-minded, loving devotion; such a person must be regarded as a saint because of making the right resolution.","key":true,"vs":[8,37],"say":"And no one is left out. Verse thirty. Even if the most sinful person resolves to worship Me with single-minded, loving devotion; such a person must be regarded as a saint because of making the right resolution.","start":163.944,"at":164.52,"end":179.472,"words":[[0.138,0.163,"And"],[0.312,0.188,"no"],[0.512,0.212,"one"],[0.738,0.15,"is"],[0.9,0.287,"left"],[1.2,0.45,"out"],[2.013,0.45,"Verse"],[2.475,0.562,"thirty"],[3.413,0.287,"Even"],[3.712,0.125,"if"],[3.85,0.